/P 103 0 R
/E (Team V.A.N. is a first-year FIRST Robotics Competition team founded to give local students a path into Space Coast industries. We believe students should be able to discover engineering through hands-on experience, and strive to give students a positive, high quality STEM education. Our members will tackle real design challenges as they learn to build, program, test, troubleshoot, and improve a competition robot together. Just as importantly, students will develop communication, leadership, project management, and problem-solving skills that carry far beyond the workshop.)
