/P 104 0 R
/E (FIRST Robotics Competition \(FRC\) is the high school program. Every January at the season kickoff, teams receive a Kit of Parts and a new game challenge. From there, students have six weeks to eight weeks to design, build, program, and test before competition. Starting in March and going through May, teams compete in head-to-head matches at regional and district events around the world, working to qualify for the FIRST Championship.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
>>
