<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 105 0 R
/E (Our region has a significant access gap: for many in southernmost Brevard and northern Indian River county, the nearest competitive robotics team is 40+ minutes away. This means long commutes, high financial commitment, and demanding schedules that are difficult to maintain throughout the build season. Those barriers can shut motivated students out before they ever get to experience competitive robotics. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
152 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 105 0 R
/E (By supporting Team V.A.N., you are helping build robotics opportunity rooted in the communities students already call home. A nearby team means more than convenience: it can be the difference between watching engineering happen and taking part in it. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
